bzip2: reading and writing of bzip2 compressed files and strings, with
the bzip2 library of the base system.

The module bz2 of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20230831/bz2.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its headers in
include/php83/php/ext/bz2.
